## Notes

- `resolveMentionProject()` is idempotent: `initProjectState` returns early once the project state is loaded, so repeated keystrokes only pay the cost of one initialization.
- Project-scoped APIs send `codx_path` per request (`connection.prepareUrl`), so preparing another project does not switch the backend's active project nor affect the chat's own requests.
- `TopBarSearch` and `SimpleEditor` still search the active project — they are not message-scoped, so they were left untouched.

